            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 icon-box">
                <i class="fas fa-headset" style="color: #f1c40f;"></i>
                <h4 class="text-black">Help Center & Support 24/7</h4>
                <p class="text-black" class="text-white">We're here to assist you every step of the way</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 icon-box">
                <i class="fas fa-car" style="color: #f1c40f;"></i>
                <h4 class="text-black">Booking any Class Vehicles</h4>
                <p class="text-black">Choose from a diverse range of vehicles tailored to your needs.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 icon-box">
                <i class="fas fa-briefcase" style="color: #f1c40f;"></i>
